<title>USA: California bond deal repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>California bond deal repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Tuesday it repriced State Public Works Board of the State of California's $46.7 million lease revenue refunding bonds, lowering yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2011 unchanged at 5.40 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>STATE PUBLIC WORKS BOARD OF THE STATE OF CALIFORNIA</p>
<p>RE: $46,685,000* LEASE REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>DEPARTMENT OF CORRECTIONS</p>
<p>CALIFORNIA STATE PRISON - IMPERIAL COUNTY</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED AND NO NEW ORDERS WILL BE TAKEN.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: AAA/A	 S&amp;P: AAA/A		 FITCH: AAA/A-</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED 2003-2011</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/01/1996    FIRST COUPON: 03/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 09/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>09/01/1997		  280M    4.25  %	  3.85</p>
<p>09/01/1998		  290M    4.25  %	  4.05</p>
<p>09/01/1999		  305M    4.25  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2000		  315M    4.40  %	  4.45</p>
<p>09/01/2001		  330M    4.60  %	100.00</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>09/01/2002		  345M    4.70  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2003  MBIA	  365M    4.60  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2004  MBIA	  380M    4.70  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2005  MBIA	  400M    4.80  %	100.00</p>
<p>09/01/2006  MBIA	  420M    4.90  %	100.00</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>09/01/2007  MBIA	  440M    5.00  %	  5.05</p>
<p>09/01/2008  MBIA	  465M    5.10  %	  5.15</p>
<p>09/01/2009  MBIA     13,310M    5.125 %	  5.25</p>
